[22.4055, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[12A\r\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K \u001b[3m\u001b[38;2;128;128;128mOops, in the footnote I wrote \"\u964d\u51aa\" and \"\u5347\u51aa\", but these are the wrong kanji. Correctly it should be       \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K \u001b[3;38;2;128;128;128m\"\u964d\u51aa\" \u2192 \"\u964d\u51aa\"... no wait, the correct terms are \"\u964d\u51aa\" vs \"\u964d\u51aa\"... the correct words are \"\u964d\u51aa\" (ji\u00e0ng    \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K \u001b[3;38;2;128;128;128mm\u00ec) and \"\u5347\u51aa\" (sh\u0113ng m\u00ec), but in Chinese it's \"\u964d\u51aa\" (ji\u00e0ng m\u00ec) and \"\u5347\u51aa\" (sh\u0113ng m\u00ec). I wrote \"\u964d\u51aa\" and   \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K \u001b[3;38;2;128;128;128m\"\u5347\u51aa\" \u2014 wrong. The correct ones are: \u964d\u51aa, \u5347\u51aa. Let me fix it in the final file... I'll either fix it with \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K \u001b[3;38;2;128;128;128medit after writing, or just fix it right now.\u001b[39m\u001b[23m                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K                                                                                                              \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K \u001b[3m\u001b[38;2;128;128;128mAlso, the footnote \"\u9ede\u6483\" should be \"\u9ede\u64ca\". Fix both.\u001b[39m\u001b[23m                                                        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[48;2;40;40;50m                                                                                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[2K\u001b[48;2;40;40;50m \u001b[39m\u001b[1medit\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128m...\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \u001b[49m\u001b[0m